<div class="claim">
<div class="ctop">
<span class="cnum">Result 03</span>
<span class="chip ok" data-print="established"><i></i>Famous casualties · established</span>
<span class="chip hint" data-print="contested"><i></i>"Fully dead" · contested</span>
